Subject: A sign-in method was added to your Steerpost account

--- text ---
GitHub was added as a way to sign in to your Steerpost account.

If this was not you, open Settings → Sign-in methods, disconnect GitHub and change your password. Review your account here: https://app.example.com/verify-email#token=abc123

Steerpost

--- html ---
<!doctype html>
<html><body style="font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.5;color:#111">
<p>GitHub was added as a way to sign in to your Steerpost account.</p>
<p>If this was not you, open Settings → Sign-in methods, disconnect GitHub and change your password. <a href="https://app.example.com/verify-email#token=abc123">Review your account</a>.</p>
<p style="color:#666;font-size:13px">Steerpost</p>
</body></html>
